      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比赛不仅仅是激烈的胜负。\n它也是追求荣耀的象征——",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b4b3931e7d97538656360704fee74ae9b5a164c849b21c1b572e767f3ffb356",
