      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛有光环笼罩一般。\n那种压迫感让人说不出话来——",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d6cf458dc7d2ceadee57f04e1e04f6df7263cb9a2905389d4721ac4dd35385a",
